      <title>三星助力 OpenAI 强化半导体供应链</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260910/%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F%E5%8A%A9%E5%8A%9B-OpenAI-%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%8D%8A%E5%AF%BC%E4%BD%93%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%93%BE/</link>
